      "created_at": "2016-08-19T14:15:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm in a PBF over on Boardgamegeek against her. Took me a few turns to realize why my HP had been cut in half, but with Next Evolution, I've pretty much stopped her main method of damage. She does seem weaker (and I already consider Kismet a weak villain), but from the sound of it, you&nbsp;<em>really</em> don't want her to flip.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Next Evolution has always been a super hard counter against kismet. No surprise there.</p>",
